[(x + 14) * 4]/48 - [x * 3]/48 = 2

This simplifies to:

[4(x + 14) - 3x]/48 = 2

Expanding the numerator:

4x + 56 - 3x = 2

Combining like terms:

(4x - 3x) + 56 = 2 → x + 56 = 2

